  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 505.08 Public Benefit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 505.08 Public Benefit. In addition to the provisions for providing a substantial public benefit specified in Env-Sw 1005, the operation of a P/T facility shall be deemed to provide a substantial public benefit when facility operations satisfy the same operating conditions as specified in Env-Sw 405.04(a) through (c).\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 500) ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2205.08); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14025, eff 8-1-24",
